# arduino-cli / Arduino IDE build output. Written next to the sketch when you
# compile without --output-dir, and it is ~2 MB of regenerable binaries per
# sketch per board.
build/
*.elf
*.bin
*.map

# tools/ output. All of it regenerates with `tools/make_report_figures.sh`:
# the replay binary is built from replay.cpp against the flight firmware's own
# Filters.cpp, the demo CSVs come from make_demo_log.py, and figures/ from
# plot_filters.py. ~4 MB of derived data with a one-command recipe -- not history.
tools/replay
tools/demo_raw.csv
tools/demo_filtered.csv
tools/figures/
*.zip
